    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Beautiful Skin Sun-Kissed Glow Bronzer Meet Charlotte Tilbury’s newest bronzing formula: Beautiful Skin Sun-Kissed Glow Bronzer. The sweat-proof bronzer for face and body blurs and hydrates the skin for up to 16 hours. The powdery cream finish melts into the skin in four universally flattering, buildable shades that intensify from a natural bronzed look to a defined contour. Here’s an easy summer glow for everyone. Why It's Special Hyaluronic acid hydrates and revitalizes the skin’s outer, visible layers Vitamin D3 converts to vitamin D on exposure to sunlight to help protect skin Finely milled pearls reflect light for an illuminating, healthy-looking bronzed glow Soft-focusing silica smooths the look and feel of the skin to help reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles Film-forming resin and polymers stretch over the skin for a humidity-resistant, long-lasting finish, sealing in skincare benefits to improve the look of skin over time How to Use After applying your foundation, lightly buff the bronzer onto the skin in circular motions using Beautiful Skin Bronzer Brush. Focus on the areas where the sun naturally hits—cheekbones, forehead, nose, and jawline. Blend the cream formula using light brush strokes to diffuse the bronzer for a second-skin glow. Other Details Size: 21 g / 0.74 oz",
