    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Big Lip Plumpgasm Mini Trio Add a little shine to the holiday lineup with Charlotte Tilbury Big Lip Plumpgasm Mini Trio. This limited-edition set includes three travel-size shades of the lip-plumping gloss, from champagne to neutral pink and sparkling strawberry. Wear them alone or layer them over your favorite lip color for glossy, fuller-looking lips on the go. What’s Included Travel-Size Big Lip Plumpgasm in Nudegasm Diamonds: Clear champagne-nude topper with gold sparkle Travel-Size Big Lip Plumpgasm in Pillow Talk Fair/Medium: Pink nude Travel-Size Big Lip Plumpgasm in Strawberry Chocolate: Cool-toned milky-pink with sparkling pink pearls and a limited-edition chocolate aroma scent (holiday exclusive) Why It's Special Three travel-size shades range from sheer champagne to soft pink and cool-toned strawberry pink Heat + Ice Technology provides a powerful plumping effect without the burn and sting CO2LLAGENEER® delivers an instant and long-term plumping and smoothing effect Hyaluronic acid adds long-lasting hydration to the lips The limited-edition trio makes an easy holiday gift, stocking stuffer, or split-and-share set Packaged in a fun lip-shaped tin for easy gifting How to Use Swipe directly onto lips for glossy color and a plumped look, or layer over lip liner or lipstick for extra shine. Other Details Set of 3 Limited edition Special value set",
