    "detailHtml": "<p>长效24小时透明眉胶，滋养并定型眉毛一整天，呈现隐形妆效。</p><p></p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Brow Fix Charlotte Tilbury's latest innovation to set your Supermodel Brow shape in place all day and night! A long-lasting 24h clear brow gel with a silk thread brow fixing formula for elasticity and gloss. It never leaves a white cast, looks stuck down or dried out. Never stiff or sticky, instead brows are full, feathered & fixed in place. Why It's Special Results after a consumer test with 105 people: * Over 90% agree Brow Fix™ grooms & shapes brows, effortlessly styles brows, has an invisible finish and leaves brows fixed in place Results after a consumer test with 30 people: * Brow Fix™ has a smudge-proof, humidity-proof & sweat-resistant formula with 24-hour wear Key Ingredients Hair fixative: For exceptional adhesion and staying power, fixing the hair in place. Natural polymer: Gives clarity and clearness, allowing the formula to spread easily through the hair but still gripping onto the hair and providing a thin, clear coating. The hair is left feeling soft and smooth and fixed in place without any flakiness. Silk thread brow fixing formula: Derived from silk, one of the strongest natural fibers in the world. It improves hair condition and leaves hair with a silky-smooth feeling and shine. Panthenol: A derivative of vitamin B5. It helps strengthen hair, retain moisture and boosts shine. Watercress Extract: Known for its hair care properties, the watercress extract hydrates and softens providing an immediate conditioning effect. How To Use For best results, use after your favorite Charlotte Tilbury brow product. Brow Fix can be worn alone to fix brows or as a top coat to your brow makeup. Simply brush through brows starting at the inner corner and work outwards for the desired brow shape. For an even fluffier brow look, brush brows upwards. Charlotte's Three Steps For Best Brows FILL - Create shape, definition and structure with - Brow Cheat OR Brow Lift FEATHER - Add hairlike texture and tint for fuller-looking brows with - Legendary Brows FIX- Brush up & hold brows perfectly in place with - Brow Fix Other Details Size: 6 g Waterproof (after 5 minutes)",
