    "detailHtml": "<p>Charlotte的红毯秘诀，仅需10分钟即可让双眼更明亮、紧致、焕然一新。</p><p>特别之处 * 吸收锁定科技配方含透明质酸，提供快速补水，同时以缓释保湿成分丰盈肌肤外观 * 蕴含Bio-Smooth Eye Contour Complex，这款精华有助于在短短10分钟内提亮、平滑并消褪眼部浮肿 使用方法 * 涂抹于清洁、干燥的眼部下方肌肤。</p><p>* 停留10分钟。</p><p>* 取下后以Tilbury Tap手法收尾！</p><p>&lt;/br> ** Tilbury小贴士：随心佩戴！</p><p>想要针对细纹并紧致皱纹外观时，将锥形端朝向鼻部。</p><p>想要针对浮肿和黑眼圈时，则调换方向。</p><p>其他细节 * 规格：60片（30对）</p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte's Hollywood Skin Secrets Immediate Eye Revival Patches Charlotte's Hollywood Skin Secrets Immediate Eye Revival Patches are Charlotte's red-carpet secret to brighter, snatched and rested eyes in just 10 minutes. Why It's Special Absorb & Lock Technology is formulated with hyaluronic acid, provides fast-acting hydration while plumping the look of skin with slow-release moisture Contains Bio-Smooth Eye Contour Complex, a serum that helps brighten, smooth and depuff the look of eyes in just 10 minutes How to Ue Apply onto clean, dry skin, under the eye. Leave on for 10 minutes. Remove and finish with the Tilbury Tap! ** Tilbury Tip: Wear them your way! Apply with the tapered end pointing towards the nose on days you want to TARGET fine lines and FIRM the LOOK of wrinkles. Switch to TARGET puffiness and dark circles. Other Details Size: 60 patches (30 pairs)",
