    "detailHtml": "<p>Charlotte三款肌肤焕活明星产品，旅行装套装，随时随地焕发光采。</p><p></p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte’s Hydration Revival Skin Care Discovery Set ($64 Value) Get dewy skin any and everywhere with the Charlotte Tilbury Hydration Revival Skin Care Discovery Set. This limited edition, travel-sized set of Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser, Charlotte’s Magic Water Cream, and Charlotte’s Glow Toner instantly revives skin with a boost of hydration. The cream-to-foam-to-milk cleanser hydrates skin post-rinse, the acid-free toner is infused with pore-refining niacinamide, and Magic Water Cream drenches skin with 100-hour hydration for an instant, dewy glow. Here’s a full skincare routine, complete with an exclusive 100% satin spa headband, packed to fly. What’s Included Mini Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser (30 ml / 1.0 fl. oz) Mini Charlotte’s Magic Water Cream (15 ml / 0.5 fl. oz) Mini Glow Toner (30 ml / 1.0 fl. oz) Exclusive 100% satin headband Why It's Special A limited edition, travel-sized skincare set of Charlotte’s skin-revitalizing icons—plus an exclusive 100% satin headband to keep hair in place during your getting ready routine The unique cream-to-foam-to-milk cleanser gently removes makeup, reduces the look of pores, and improves the look of tone and texture Charlotte’s Magic Water Cream is enriched with niacinamide and a biopeptide complex to smooth and plump your skin Glow Toner is acid-free and infused with pore-refining niacinamide for glass-like skin How to Use Start by cleansing the skin. Apply to the palm of your hand and emulsify with warm water. Gently rub hands together and apply evenly across the face, massaging into skin. Rinse off fully with warm water. Next, swipe on Glow Toner using a cleansing pad or fingertips to tone and hydrate. Follow by massaging Charlotte’s Magic Water Cream into skin and finish with Charlotte’s “Tilbury Tap” technique to boost circulation, for smoother, plumper looking skin. Other Details Set of 3 Limited edition Special value",
