    "detailHtml": "<p>三款护肤与唇部必备品，随时随地让肌肤与双唇水润、更光滑。</p><p></p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte’s Iconic Magic Skin + Lip Secrets Charlotte Tilbury’s Iconic Magic Skin + Lip Secrets takes the guesswork out of holiday gifting. The limited-edition set features three skin-and-lip essentials to hydrate, smooth, brighten, and condition, plus a limited-edition travel pouch. It’s an easy way to (self) gift a complete routine. What’s Included Travel-Size Charlotte’s Magic Cream (15 ml) Travel-Size Charlotte’s Magic Serum Crystal Elixir (10 ml) Charlotte’s Magic Lip Oil Crystal Elixir (8 ml) Limited-Edition Travel Pouch Why It's Special Three skin-and-lip essentials create an easy routine for hydrating, smoothing, and refreshing on the go Charlotte’s Magic Serum Crystal Elixir helps brighten, hydrate, and improve the look of firmness Charlotte’s Magic Cream helps smooth, plump, and moisturize while prepping skin for makeup Charlotte’s Magic Lip Oil Crystal Elixir conditions lips and helps them look smoother and more plump The limited-edition travel pouch makes the set easy to gift, pack, and keep organized How to Use Charlotte’s Magic Serum Crystal Elixir Massage a few drops into skin until absorbed. Charlotte’s Magic Cream Smooth over the face and neck, then gently massage into skin. Charlotte’s Magic Lip Oil Crystal Elixir Roll over lips throughout the day as needed, or wear overnight as a conditioning treatment. Other Details Set of 3 Limited edition Special value set",
