    "detailHtml": "<p>一款保湿、平滑、紧致的身体乳霜，灵感源自Charlotte畅销的Magic Cream</p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Magic Body Cream Inspired by the bestselling Charlotte’s Magic Cream, the Charlotte Tilbury Magic Body Cream gives you an instant full body glow from head to toe. This long-awaited body moisturizer is infused with ingredients that improve your skin's look and feel every time you apply it. A skin-loving blend of energizing caffeine, hyaluronic acid, and Charlotte’s Magic 8 matrix of ingredients hydrate, nourish, firm, tighten, and smooth your skin. Why It's Special Algaktiv™ Uplift is clinically proven to firm, tighten, and lift for smooth and toned-looking skin Energizing caffeine tightens, brightens, and energizes for smoother skin. It also helps reduce the appearance of cellulite. Glowing glycerin intensely moisturizes for more hydrated, plump skin Rose extract helps even skin tone and visibly improves elasticity Charlotte’s Magic 8 Matrix hydrates your skin with powerful ingredients such as hydrating hyaluronic acid, brightening vitamins C + E, soothing aloe vera, and nourishing shea butter while infusing skin with a calming scent How to Use Apply to clean, dry skin daily using Charlotte’s magic massage technique: Using the palm of your hand, massage in upward sweeping motions – focusing on the stomach and thighs – towards the heart to help boost circulation and stimulate blood flow. Lymphatic Drainage Massage: Using the fingertips, gently glide over the skin towards the nearest lymph node, encouraging fluid drainage and the removal of toxins. Help Relieve Joint Tension: Gently massage in circular movements around the joints–ankles, kneecaps, elbows and wrists–to relieve tension. Invigorate the skin with cupping massage: Briskly brush the skin with firm alternate hand strokes around areas such as the thighs and biceps, to invigorate the skin and help release tension. Other Details Allure Best of Beauty Award Winner 2023 (Best Body-Care Splurge) Available sizes: 50ml, 200 ml Vegan",
