    "desc": "一款奇迹保湿霜与妆前乳二合一，这款强效配方数秒内焕活肌肤，逆转10种可见衰老迹象，同时提升水润度",
    "detail": "一款奇迹保湿霜与妆前乳二合一，这款强效配方数秒内焕活肌肤，逆转10种可见衰老迹象，同时提升水润度",
    "detailHtml": "<p>一款奇迹保湿霜与妆前乳二合一，这款强效配方数秒内焕活肌肤，逆转10种可见衰老迹象，同时提升水润度</p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Magic Cream Anti-Aging Moisturizer with Hyaluronic Acid The cult-classic Magic Cream—but better. Charlotte Tilbury’s supercharged new Magic Cream formula instantly revives the look of skin in as little as 28 seconds while targeting 10 visible signs of aging, from dryness and dullness to fine lines and loss of firmness. Powered by the first-ever Recoverstem™ Peptide and Triple Power Lift Mesh Technology™, this upgraded formula drenches skin in hydration, boosts glow, and creates a smoother complexion instantly and over time. Acting as a moisturizer and primer in one, it grips and locks makeup in place for a flawless, crease-resistant finish that looks better and lasts longer. Over time, skin appears lifted, youthful, and radiant—like a facelift in a jar*. Why It's Special Revives skin in 28 seconds and reverses 10 visible signs of aging Recoverstem™ Peptide is the world’s first hyper-intelligent peptide blend, extracted from the stem cells of the Eternal Jasmine Youth Plant, containing 100+ intelligent peptides in every drop to boost the five biomarkers of skin recovery Recoverstem™ Peptide acts like your own personal skin consultant assessing your skin’s needs and delivers them to you Triple Power Cushion + Lift Mesh Technology™ is a plump-effect complex infused with rosehip oil, oat extract, and barrier-boosting ectoin Doubles as a moisturizer and primer to lock in flawless, crease-resistant makeup that lasts longer and looks better Boosts skin hydration and glow instantly and over time Clinical Results Clinically proven to hydrate, improve the appearance of fine lines, and perfectly primes the skin for foundation** Clinically proven to improve the appearance of redness and uneven texture** Clinically proven to improve the appearance of fine lines + wrinkles** *Based on a test with 253 people, after 8 weeks of use **Based on a test with 253 people, after 28 days with twice daily application How to Use Apply morning and night. For best results, apply with Charlotte’s 5-step Magic Massage technique: 1. Complexion Boost: Start from the lower cheek and sweep the cream out and up. Tap fingertips across the cheeks avoiding the eye contour. 2. Define Contours: Placing fingers under cheekbones, apply light pressure and smooth outwards and upwards along the cheekbone. 3. Define Jawline: Gently pinch chin with fingers moving up and along your jawline in one sweeping motion. 4. Smooth Furrows: Starting in the middle of the forehead, massage in circular motions, moving out to the temples. Pat the excess into the skin using your ring finger. 5. Massage Neck and Décolletage: Applying gentle pressure, massage along the décolletage and up to the neck in an upward lifting motion. Other Details Available Sizes: 15 ml, 30 ml, 50 ml, 50 ml Refill, 150 ml Non-comedogenic",
    "descCorrupt": false,
    "translated": true,
