    "detail": "独特的乳霜转泡沫再转乳液配方，温和清洁并在冲洗后滋润肌肤。",
    "detailHtml": "<p>独特的乳霜转泡沫再转乳液配方，温和清洁并在冲洗后滋润肌肤。</p><p></p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte’s Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte’s Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser deeply cleanses skin without drying it out. The unique cream-to-foam-to-milk formula gently removes makeup, reduces the look pores, and improves the look of tone and texture. Use the 3-in-1 formula as a cleanser or mask to plump skin with hydration that continues even after rinsing. Key Ingredients Biomimetic Barrier Shield helps prevent water loss Hydrating hyaluronic acid leaves skin looking smoother and plumper Smoothing Peptide Complex reduces the appearance of pores How to Use Apply a small amount to the palm of the hand. Emulsify with warm water and gently rub your hands together. Apply evenly across the face and massage into the skin. Rinse off with warm water. Use in the morning and night to deeply cleanse, purify, and melt away all makeup and impurities. Use gently around the eye area. If product gets into eyes, rinse thoroughly with warm water. For best results, use Charlotte’s Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser before Charlotte’s Magic Cream or Magic Water Cream for immediate skin revival and the perfect base for makeup. Suitable for all skin types. Other Details Size: 120 ml / 30 ml For all skin types",
    "descCorrupt": false,
    "translated": true,
    "sku": "78580",
