    "desc": "日常双件套，打造光滑、水润光采，包含Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser和Magic Water Cream，让肌肤持久水润。套装内容 * Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser（30 ml / 1 fl oz） * Charlotte's Magic Water Cream（15 ml / 0.5 fl oz） 特别之处 这套清洁与保湿组合能瞬间焕活肌肤，呈现水润玻璃般光采。Magic Cleanser是不干燥的乳霜转泡沫配方，能清洁并卸除彩妆。Magic Water Cream是无香精凝胶，为肌肤注入水分并细致毛",
    "detail": "日常双件套，打造光滑、水润光采，包含Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser和Magic Water Cream，让肌肤持久水润。套装内容 * Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser（30 ml / 1 fl oz） * Charlotte's Magic Water Cream（15 ml / 0.5 fl oz） 特别之处 这套清洁与保湿组合能瞬间焕活肌肤，呈现水润玻璃般光采。Magic Cleanser是不干燥的乳霜转泡沫配方，能清洁并卸除彩妆。Magic Water Cream是无香精凝胶，为肌肤注入水分并细致毛孔外观。使用方法 第一步：用Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser清洁： * 取少量于掌心。 * 用温水乳化，双手轻轻揉搓。 * 均匀涂抹于面部并按摩吸收。 * 用温水冲洗干净。 第二步：用Charlotte's Magic Water Cream保湿： * 洁面后按摩于肌肤。 * 以Charlotte的Tilbury Tap手法收尾，从面部中央向外轻轻拍打。促进循环，打造更光滑、更丰盈的肌肤外观。其他细节 * 两件套",
    "detailHtml": "<p>日常双件套，打造光滑、水润光采，包含Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser和Magic Water Cream，让肌肤持久水润。</p><p>套装内容 * Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser（30 ml / 1 fl oz） * Charlotte's Magic Water Cream（15 ml / 0.5 fl oz） 特别之处 这套清洁与保湿组合能瞬间焕活肌肤，呈现水润玻璃般光采。</p><p>Magic Cleanser是不干燥的乳霜转泡沫配方，能清洁并卸除彩妆。</p><p>Magic Water Cream是无香精凝胶，为肌肤注入水分并细致毛孔外观。</p><p>使用方法 第一步：用Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser清洁： * 取少量于掌心。</p><p>* 用温水乳化，双手轻轻揉搓。</p><p>* 均匀涂抹于面部并按摩吸收。</p><p>* 用温水冲洗干净。</p><p>第二步：用Charlotte's Magic Water Cream保湿： * 洁面后按摩于肌肤。</p><p>* 以Charlotte的Tilbury Tap手法收尾，从面部中央向外轻轻拍打。</p><p>促进循环，打造更光滑、更丰盈的肌肤外观。</p><p>其他细节 * 两件套</p>",
    "descLongEn": "About Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Duo Charlotte Tilbury Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Duo is a daily duo for a smooth, hydrated glow featuring Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser and Magic Water Cream leaving your skin with long-lasting hydration. What's Included Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser (30 ml / 1 fl oz) Charlotte's Magic Water Cream (15 ml / 0.5 fl oz) Why It's Special This cleanse and hydrate duo instantly revives your skin for a dewy, glasslike glow. Magic Cleanser is a non-drying, cream-to-foam formula that cleanses and removes makeup. Magic Water Cream is a fragrance-free gel that drenches the skin in hydration and refines the look of pores. How to Use Step 1: Cleanse with Charlotte's Magic Hydration Revival Cleanser: Apply a small amount to the palm of the hand. Emulsify with warm water and gently rub hands together. Apply evenly across the face and massage into skin. Rinse off with warm water. Step 2: Hydrate with Charlotte's Magic Water Cream: Massage into skin after cleansing. Finish with Charlotte’s Tilbury Tap technique, gently tapping from the center of your face outward in a pitter-patter motion. This boost to circulation promotes smoother, plumper-looking skin. Other Details Set of two",
    "descCorrupt": false,
    "translated": true,
